:name: nRF52840 TIMER0 + GPIOTE interrupts
:description: nice!nano model with a button on P0.11; firmware blinks P0.15 from a timer IRQ and counts button IRQs.
$elf?=$ex_out/nrf_irq.elf

using sysbus
mach create "nrfirq"
machine LoadPlatformDescription $ex_dir/nrf_irq.repl
showAnalyzer uart0
sysbus LoadELF $elf
